@media(max-width:500px){.receiver-paste{flex-direction:column}.receiver-paste button{width:100%}}

</style></head><body>
<header class="top football-navbar"><div class="nav football-nav"><div class="logo brand-cluster">
<button class="logo-mark football-ball-link" id="ballTransfer" type="button" title="Klik bola untuk scan QR" aria-label="Buka pemindai barcode">⚽</button>
<button class="brand-lines brand-wordmark" id="brandHome" type="button" aria-label="Kembali ke beranda"><strong>FOOTBALL<span>ZONE</span></strong><small>THE GAME STARTS HERE</small></button></div>
<nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Navigasi"><button class="navlink active" id="navHome" type="button">Beranda</button><button class="navlink" id="navTips" type="button">Strategi</button></nav>
</div></header>
<main id="footballHome" class="football-home">
  <section class="stadium-hero">
    <div class="stadium-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-container">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="hero-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> WELCOME TO THE BEAUTIFUL GAME</span>
        <h1>MORE THAN<br><em>JUST A GAME.</em></h1>
        <p>Sepak bola adalah tentang gairah, strategi, dan kebersamaan. Pindai barcode QR pengirim melalui ikon bola di atas.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button type="button" class="hero-primary" id="heroLearn">Jelajahi Strategi <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats"><div><strong>90<span>′</span></strong><small>FULL TIME</small></div><span class="stat-rule"></span><div><strong>11<span>vs</span>11</strong><small>ONE PASSION</small></div><span class="stat-rule"></span><div><strong>∞</strong><small>THE LOVE OF GAME</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pitch-scene" aria-label="Ilustrasi lapangan sepak bola dengan formasi 4-3-3">
        <div class="pitch-label"><span class="pitch-led"></span> TACTICAL BOARD <b>4 · 3 · 3</b></div>
        <div class="pitch-frame">
          <div class="pitch-grid">
            <div class="pitch-border"></div><div class="pitch-halfway"></div><div class="pitch-circle"></div><div class="pitch-penalty top-penalty"></div><div class="pitch-goalarea top-goal"></div><div class="pitch-penalty bottom-penalty"></div><div class="pitch-goalarea bottom-goal"></div><div class="pitch-center"></div>
            <span class="player p1">9</span><span class="player p2">11</span><span class="player p3">7</span>
            <span class="player p4">8</span><span class="player p5">10</span><span class="player p6">6</span>
            <span class="player p7">3</span><span class="player p8">4</span><span class="player p9">5</span><span class="player p10">2</span><span class="player keeper">1</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pitch-bottom"><span>⚡ ATTACKING FORMATION</span><strong>PLAY BOLD.</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stadium-bottom"><span>THE PITCH IS OUR HOME</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-content" id="tacticsSection">
    <div class="section-top"><div><div class="section-label">THE PLAYBOOK / 01</div><h2>HIDUPKAN <span>PERMAINAN.</span></h2></div><p>Tiga hal yang membuat setiap pertandingan punya cerita.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card tactics-card"><div class="feature-icon">◈</div><span class="feature-num">01 / FORMASI</span><h3>Bangun Strategi</h3><p>Susun lini bertahan, kuasai lini tengah, dan ciptakan peluang dengan formasi 4–3–3.</p><div class="feature-bottom">TACTICAL MINDSET <span>↗</span></div></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">⚡</div><span class="feature-num">02 / LATIHAN</span><h3>Asah Skill</h3><p>Kontrol bola, umpan cepat, dan pergerakan tanpa bola menjadi dasar permainan yang solid.</p><div class="feature-bottom">TRAINING GROUND <span>↗</span></div></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">★</div><span class="feature-num">03 / TEAMWORK</span><h3>Kerja Sama Tim</h3><p>Komunikasi, disiplin posisi, dan semangat tim adalah kunci untuk menciptakan pertandingan yang seru.</p><div class="feature-bottom">ONE TEAM, ONE DREAM <span>↗</span></div></article>
    </div>
    <div class="strategy-banner"><div class="strategy-number">4<span>—</span>3<span>—</span>3</div><div><span>GAME PLAN</span><h3>KUASAI LAPANGAN.<br>MENANGKAN MOMEN.</h3><p>Tetap terhubung dengan permainan, di dalam dan di luar lapangan.</p></div><span class="gameplan-label">PLAY WITH PASSION ⚽</span></div>
  </section>
  <footer class="football-footer"><span>⚽ FOOTBALL<span class="brand-green">ZONE</span></span><small>FOOTBALL INSPIRED • DESIGNED FOR THE GAME</small></footer>
</main>
<main class="wrap transfer-wrap hidden" id="transferApp"><div class="transfer-heading"><button class="back-home" id="backHome" type="button">← &nbsp; Kembali ke Beranda</button>
<div class="transfer-headline"><div><div class="section-label">FOOTBALLZONE / HOSTING PENERIMA</div><h1>SCAN <span>BARCODE.</span></h1>
<p>Scan QR dari hosting pengirim. Daftar file langsung muncul dan selalu diperbarui tanpa tombol Segarkan.</p></div>
<div class="idle-chip"><span class="idle-icon">◷</span><span>OTOMATIS KEMBALI<small id="idleCountdown">01:00</small></span></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><section class="content"><h2 class="section-title">Terima File dari Domain Lain</h2>
<p class="muted">Arahkan kamera ke kode QR pada layar pengirim, meskipun berbeda domain, hosting, ataupun jaringan internet.</p>
<div id="scannerPane"><div class="scan-stage hidden" id="scanStage"><video id="scanVideo" autoplay muted playsinline></video><div class="scan-frame"></div><div class="scanning-line"></div></div>
<div class="status-center" id="scannerStatus">Tekan Buka Kamera &amp; Scan untuk memulai.</div>
<div class="action-group"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="scanBtn" type="button">▦ &nbsp; Buka Kamera &amp; Scan</button><button class="btn btn-ghost hidden" type="button" id="stopScanBtn">Tutup Kamera</button></div>
<div class="receiver-paste"><input class="textbox" id="qrLinkInput" type="url" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Alternatif: tempel tautan QR dari pengirim"><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="pasteConnect">Buka Tautan</button></div>
<div class="box-note"><strong>Akses kamera:</strong> gunakan HTTPS dan izinkan akses kamera. Jika dibatasi MDM, salin tautan QR dari pengirim lalu tempel di kolom atas.</div></div>
<div id="remoteFiles" class="hidden"><div class="stat"><span class="dot"></span> Barcode terhubung ke hosting pengirim</div>
<div class="source-display"><span>Server pengirim: <b id="sourceHost"></b></span><button id="scanOtherBtn" class="btn btn-ghost" type="button">▦ Scan QR Lain</button></div>
<div class="files-head"><h3>File yang Dibagikan <span class="pill" id="remoteCount">0</span></h3><span class="auto-sync" id="remoteSync"><span class="sync-indicator"></span> Update otomatis · 2 detik</span></div>
<input id="searchFiles" class="textbox" placeholder="Cari file..." style="padding:12px"><div class="file-list" id="remoteList" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
<p class="receiver-tip">Hanya file yang dipilih oleh pengirim yang tersedia. Unduhan langsung berasal dari hosting pengirim, bukan disimpan di hosting penerima.</p></div>
</section></div><p class="transfer-bottom-note">⚽ &nbsp; Tanpa aktivitas 1 menit akan kembali ke beranda. Scan QR tidak membutuhkan PIN atau tombol Hubungkan.</p></main>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>
<script>
'use strict';
const $ = id=>document.getElementById(id);
const IDLE_MS=60000,POLL_MS=2000;
let activePage='home', lastActivity=Date.now(), view=null, remoteItems=[], fileSig=null;
let scanStream=null, scanning=false, scanTimer=0, scanBusy=false, scanDetector=null, listBusy=false, epoch=0;
function toast(msg){const node=$('toast');node.textContent=msg;node.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toast.timer);toast.timer=setTimeout(()=>node.classList.remove('show'),5000)}
function stopScanner(){scanning=false;scanBusy=false;if(scanTimer)cancelAnimationFrame(scanTimer);scanTimer=0;if(scanStream){scanStream.getTracks().forEach(t=>t.stop());scanStream=null}const vid=$('scanVideo');vid.pause();vid.srcObject=null;$('scanStage').classList.add('hidden');$('scanBtn').classList.remove('hidden');$('stopScanBtn').classList.add('hidden')}
function home(reason=''){activePage='home';epoch++;stopScanner();view=null;remoteItems=[];fileSig=null;$('footballHome').classList.remove('hidden');$('transferApp').classList.add('hidden');$('navHome').classList.add('active');$('navTips').classList.remove('active');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});if(reason)toast(reason)}
function transfer(autoScan=true){activePage='transfer';epoch++;lastActivity=Date.now();$('footballHome').classList.add('hidden');$('transferApp').classList.remove('hidden');$('navHome').classList.remove('active');$('navTips').classList.remove('active');$('idleCountdown').textContent='01:00';window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});if(autoScan)startScanner()}
function showTactics(){home();$('navHome').classList.remove('active');$('navTips').classList.add('active');$('tacticsSection').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})}
$('ballTransfer').onclick=()=>transfer();$('brandHome').onclick=$('navHome').onclick=$('backHome').onclick=()=>home();$('navTips').onclick=$('heroLearn').onclick=showTactics;
for(const ev of ['pointerdown','touchstart','keydown','input','change','scroll'])document.addEventListener(ev,()=>{if(activePage==='transfer')lastActivity=Date.now()},{passive:true});
setInterval(()=>{if(activePage!=='transfer')return;const remain=Math.max(0,IDLE_MS-Date.now()+lastActivity);let secs=Math.ceil(remain/1000);$('idleCountdown').textContent=String(Math.floor(secs/60)).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(secs%60).padStart(2,'0');if(!remain)home('Tidak ada aktivitas selama 1 menit. Kembali ke beranda sepak bola.')},500);
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(!document.hidden&&activePage==='transfer')void poll()});
function parseQR(raw){let url;try{url=new URL(raw.trim())}catch(e){return null}const localDev=location.hostname==='localhost'||location.hostname==='127.0.0.1';if(url.protocol!=='https:'&&!(localDev&&url.protocol==='http:'))return null;if(url.username||url.password)return null;if(!url.hash.startsWith('#join='))return null;if(!/^\/[^?#]*$/.test(url.pathname))return null;let claim;try{claim=decodeURIComponent(url.hash.slice(6))}catch(e){return null}const m=/^([A-F0-9]{20})\.([a-f0-9]{48})$/i.exec(claim);if(!m)return null;return {base:url.origin+url.pathname,address:m[1].toUpperCase(),qr_token:m[2].toLowerCase(),host:url.host}}
async function callRemote(action,details){const body=new FormData();body.append('address',details.address);body.append('qr_token',details.qr_token);let result,response;try{response=await fetch(details.base+'?api='+encodeURIComponent(action),{method:'POST',body,mode:'cors',credentials:'omit',cache:'no-store',referrerPolicy:'no-referrer'});}catch(e){throw new Error('Gagal terhubung. Pastikan hosting pengirim memakai versi dua-hosting, HTTPS, dan mendukung CORS.')}try{result=await response.json()}catch(e){throw new Error('Respons API pengirim bukan JSON.')}if(!response.ok||!result.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Gagal mengambil data dari pengirim.');return result}
function readableSize(bytes){if(bytes<1024)return bytes+' B';let n=Number(bytes),i=-1;do{n/=1024;i++}while(n>=1024&&i<3);return n.toFixed(1)+' '+['KB','MB','GB','TB'][i]}
function renderRows(){const search=$('searchFiles').value.toLowerCase();const root=$('remoteList');root.replaceChildren();const list=remoteItems.filter(f=>f.name.toLowerCase().includes(search));if(!list.length){const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='empty';el.textContent=remoteItems.length?'Tidak ada file sesuai pencarian.':'Belum ada file dibagikan.';root.append(el);return}for(const file of list){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='file-row';const icon=document.createElement('div');icon.className='file-icon';icon.textContent=/\.(jpe?g|png|webp|gif)$/i.test(file.name)?'▧':/\.(pdf|docx?|xlsx?|txt)$/i.test(file.name)?'▤':'▣';const content=document.createElement('div');content.className='file-main';const name=document.createElement('div');name.className='file-name';name.textContent=file.name;const sub=document.createElement('div');sub.className='file-meta';sub.textContent=readableSize(file.size)+' • '+new Date(file.modified*1000).toLocaleString('id-ID');content.append(name,sub);const btn=document.createElement('button');btn.type='button';btn.className='iconbtn';btn.textContent='↓ Unduh';btn.onclick=()=>downloadFile(file.id);row.append(icon,content,btn);root.append(row)}}
$('searchFiles').oninput=renderRows;
// Browser initiates a direct POST form download to origin A; avoids loading large files into memory.
function downloadFile(fileId){if(!view)return;const form=document.createElement('form');form.method='POST';form.action=view.base+'?api=download';form.target='_blank';form.style.display='none';const values={address:view.address,qr_token:view.qr_token,file:fileId};for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(values)){const input=document.createElement('input');input.type='hidden';input.name=key;input.value=value;form.append(input)}document.body.append(form);form.submit();setTimeout(()=>form.remove(),3000)}
async function remoteList(silent=false){if(!view||listBusy||activePage!=='transfer'||document.hidden)return;const target=view,at=epoch;listBusy=true;try{const res=await callRemote('list',target);if(!view||view!==target||at!==epoch||activePage!=='transfer')return;const next=JSON.stringify(res.files.map(f=>[f.id,f.name,f.size,f.modified]));if(next!==fileSig){fileSig=next;remoteItems=res.files;$('remoteCount').textContent=res.files.length;renderRows()}$('remoteSync').classList.remove('sync-offline');$('remoteSync').lastChild.textContent=' Update otomatis · 2 detik';}catch(e){if(!view||view!==target||at!==epoch)return;$('remoteSync').classList.add('sync-offline');$('remoteSync').lastChild.textContent=' Koneksi terputus · mencoba ulang';if(!silent)toast(e.message);if(/kedaluwarsa|tidak ditemukan|barcode tidak valid|akses sudah berakhir/i.test(e.message)){view=null;fileSig=null;$('remoteFiles').classList.add('hidden');$('scannerPane').classList.remove('hidden');$('scannerStatus').textContent='Sesi atau barcode sudah tidak berlaku. Scan ulang QR pengirim.'}}finally{listBusy=false}}
function poll(){if(view&&activePage==='transfer')void remoteList(true)}setInterval(poll,POLL_MS);
async function join(raw){const parsed=parseQR(raw);if(!parsed){toast('QR bukan tautan pengirim FootballZone yang valid atau tidak memakai HTTPS.');return false}stopScanner();if(activePage!=='transfer')transfer(false);view=parsed;epoch++;fileSig=null;remoteItems=[];$('sourceHost').textContent=parsed.host;$('remoteCount').textContent='0';$('remoteFiles').classList.remove('hidden');$('scannerPane').classList.add('hidden');$('remoteList').replaceChildren();$('qrLinkInput').value='';await remoteList();return true}
let fallbackLoading=null;
function loadFallback(){if(typeof window.jsQR==='function')return Promise.resolve();if(fallbackLoading)return fallbackLoading;fallbackLoading=new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const s=document.createElement('script');s.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jsqr@1.4.0/dist/jsQR.js';s.onload=()=>window.jsQR?resolve():reject(Error('Pustaka pemindai tak tersedia'));s.onerror=()=>reject(Error('Tidak dapat memuat pemindai QR'));document.head.append(s)});return fallbackLoading}
async function startScanner(){if(activePage!=='transfer')return;view=null;$('remoteFiles').classList.add('hidden');$('scannerPane').classList.remove('hidden');if(scanning||scanStream)return;if(!isSecureContext||!navigator.mediaDevices?.getUserMedia){$('scannerStatus').textContent='Kamera browser memerlukan HTTPS dan izin akses kamera.';return}
try{ // Request camera from the initial click before waiting for decoder fallback.
$('scannerStatus').textContent='Meminta izin kamera...';scanStream=await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({audio:false,video:{facingMode:{ideal:'environment'},width:{ideal:1280},height:{ideal:720}}});if(activePage!=='transfer'){stopScanner();return}const video=$('scanVideo');video.srcObject=scanStream;await video.play();if(activePage!=='transfer'){stopScanner();return}if('BarcodeDetector' in window){scanDetector=new BarcodeDetector({formats:['qr_code']})}else{scanDetector=null;await loadFallback()}
$('scanStage').classList.remove('hidden');$('scanBtn').classList.add('hidden');$('stopScanBtn').classList.remove('hidden');$('scannerStatus').textContent='Arahkan kamera ke QR pengirim. Daftar file akan terbuka otomatis.';scanning=true;
const tick=async()=>{if(!scanning||activePage!=='transfer')return;if(scanBusy){scanTimer=requestAnimationFrame(tick);return}scanBusy=true;try{let raw='';if(scanDetector){const found=await scanDetector.detect(video);if(found.length)raw=found[0].rawValue}else if(video.readyState>=2&&typeof window.jsQR==='function'){const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=video.videoWidth;canvas.height=video.videoHeight;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{willReadFrequently:true});ctx.drawImage(video,0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);const result=jsQR(ctx.getImageData(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height).data,canvas.width,canvas.height,{inversionAttempts:'dontInvert'});if(result)raw=result.data}if(raw){const valid=await join(raw);if(valid)return}}catch(e){/* bad video frame; continue */}finally{scanBusy=false}if(scanning)scanTimer=requestAnimationFrame(tick)};scanTimer=requestAnimationFrame(tick)}catch(e){stopScanner();$('scannerStatus').textContent=e.name==='NotAllowedError'?'Izin kamera ditolak; aktifkan izin kamera pada browser.':'Tidak bisa membuka kamera/pemindai: '+e.message}}
$('scanBtn').onclick=startScanner;$('stopScanBtn').onclick=()=>{stopScanner();$('scannerStatus').textContent='Kamera ditutup. Tekan Buka Kamera & Scan untuk mencoba lagi.'};$('scanOtherBtn').onclick=()=>{view=null;fileSig=null;stopScanner();startScanner()};
$('pasteConnect').onclick=()=>join($('qrLinkInput').value);$('qrLinkInput').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();join($('qrLinkInput').value)}};
// Also accept a link to receiver with embedded sender link as a bookmark, never store token.
try{const qs=new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1));const url=qs.get('sender');if(url){history.replaceState(null,'',location.pathname+location.search);transfer(false);join(url)}}catch(e){}
</script></body></html>
